[?2004l[?2004h> can be re-driven with `npm run replay-backlog`.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Backlog replay preserves the payments on-call refund-storm guard (20 events per run,
[?2004l[?2004h> 120 seconds between runs). Run subsequent batches after the cooldown until no events
[?2004l[?2004h> remain. Processed event IDs persist in `DATA_DIR`, so retries do not create another
[?2004l[?2004h> refund or audit entry. Keep the same data directory when restarting or replaying.
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> Refunds in INR up to and including 500000 paise (₹5,000) are auto-approved; larger
[?2004l[?2004h> refunds and other currencies go to manual review.
